  "_comment": "Set bonuses. Wearing `pieces` or more items of the same set adds `value` to `stat` (each step adds on top of the ones before). All numbers are PLACEHOLDERS to tune by feel.",
  "starter_armor_sets": [],
  "_race_sets": "Race gear sets (design/gdd/race-gear-sets.md 3.5-3.10, Boss 2026-11-13; built by tools/items/build_race_gear.py). kind race: ONE piece, the race weapon of the class (Boss 2026-11-16; armour is class-bound and has no set). The set option works only when the card's race equals `race`; the single step boosts the race passive with cell_mod words (logic/race_sets.gd). Its numbers x tier_mul of the weapon's tier (white starter 0.75, PO default; step numbers are PLACEHOLDERS). bonuses stays empty: ItemCatalog.set_bonus ignores race sets.",
  "_boss_sets": "Boss accessory sets (design/gdd/boss-loot.md 2, Boss 2026-11-16). kind boss: count the set's pieces worn on a card (earring/bracelet/ring can be worn twice, 8 at most); steps 2/4/6 apply stat_mod (mul = percent of the stat after gear) in logic/stats.gd via logic/boss_loot.gd. A step's numbers x tier_mul of the LOWEST tier among the N best pieces it counts, as race sets."
}
